    "body": "This implementation is not what has been proposed in the paper. The sensitivities are being computed via Hessian, which is against the paper's main novelty. As mentioned in the paper, the quantization should be per-row and asymmetric, but in the code, it is symmetric. \n\nConsidering this is an accepted paper in ICLR, it is very disappointing that there is no correct available implementation...",
