    "body": "`save_pretrained()` does not write `auto_map` entries or custom Python files,\r\ncausing `AutoProcessor.from_pretrained(trust_remote_code=True)` to silently\r\nfall back to `LlamaTokenizerFast` instead of [PrismaticProcessor](cci:2://file:///home/kdhluck/vla/QVLA/openvla/prismatic/extern/hf/processing_prismatic.py:174:0-251:87).\r\n\r\nAfter conversion, now automatically:\r\n- Injects `auto_map` into [config.json](cci:7://file:///home/kdhluck/vla/QVLA/openvla/models/openvla-7b-hf/config.json:0:0-0:0) and [preprocessor_config.json](cci:7://file:///home/kdhluck/vla/QVLA/openvla/models/openvla-7b-hf/preprocessor_config.json:0:0-0:0)\r\n- Copies `{configuration,modeling,processing}_prismatic.py` to the output dir\r\n\r\nMirrors the structure of the official `openvla/openvla-7b` HF hub checkpoint.\r\n",
